        "id": "LilliaQ",
        "name": "Blooming Blows",
        "description": "Passively, Lillia gains stacking Move Speed when hitting enemies with spells. She can activate this to deal magic damage to nearby enemies, dealing extra true damage on the edge.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Lillia's Ability hits grant <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(3/4/5/6/7% + (0.03% Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> for 6.5 seconds, stacking up to 4 times.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Lillia whirls her censer, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(35/45/55/65/75 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, plus an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(35/45/55/65/75 + (35% Ability Power)) true damage</span> at the outer edge.",
